# {{project_name}}

A scraping project on [dailyscraper](https://dailyscraper.com).

```
config/development/   settings for runs on this machine
config/production/    settings for the server (DAILYSCRAPER_ENV=production)
scrapers/             scraper packages, one folder each
data/                 results, run history, browser profiles (not committed)
```

First time:

```
uv sync
uv run playwright install chromium
```

Run every scraper listed in `config/development/scrapers.json`:

```
uv run dailyscraper run
```

Run one scraper, with the browser window visible:

```
uv run dailyscraper run example_catalog --headed
```

Add a scraper package:

```
uv run dailyscraper new my_shop
```

Past runs and their results:

```
uv run dailyscraper runs
uv run dailyscraper runs show RUN_ID
```
